[00:36.19] Have you ever been up in a holler
[00:36.90] Have you ever heard
[00:37.53] A mountain man cough his life away
[00:39.86] From diggin' that black coal
[00:41.86] In those dark mines, those dark mines
[00:46.49] If you had you might just understand
[00:50.12] The reason that they left it all behind
